message: "If you use this software or experimental materials in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SoCo_CoFr_Survey: Interactive Tasks and Questionnaire Generator for SoSci Survey"
abstract: >-
  An open-source experimental framework and automated SoSci Survey questionnaire
  generator designed for investigating the Monitoring Frequency Effect (MFE),
  feedback timing, and intrinsic motivation. Includes interactive browser-based
  mini-game tasks (Blind Tape Measure, Shape Slicing, Geolocation Guessing),
  custom layout styling, randomized broken-stick point distribution algorithms,
  and dynamic feedback popups.
